      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This looks like a recurrence of the previously reported Read Only issues:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1222-inputfield-keyboard-doesnt-respect-readonly\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1400-clear-button-doesnt-respect-readonly",
