  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-09-29T15:57:28.471Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In Open Beta, users are able to modify the contents of InputField, TMP_InputField, and VRCUrlInputField even when Read Only is enabled.\n\nEven with Read Only enabled, text can still be entered or deleted just like in a normal input field, so these fields can no longer be used as read-only fields. This occurs with InputField, TMP_InputField, and VRCUrlInputField.\n\nThese fields are used for purposes such as displaying read-only URLs or input fields whose contents should only be updated from Udon, so I would appreciate it if the Read Only setting could be respected correctly.",
